1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:52,570
4 months later

25
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:54,570
Valley above the
Immortal Graveyard

26
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,330
If I enter a spatial rift,

27
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:03,890
I will lose my anchor point to the outside.

28
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,890
But if I don't,

29
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,570
it will be difficult to find my avatar...

30
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:17,050
This person is bad news.

31
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,500
Fellow cultivator,

32
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:36,300
we don’t even know each other.

33
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,970
Why must you act like this ?!

34
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:40,560
There were 7 of you when you entered.

35
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,970
Why did only the two of you come out ?

36
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,730
I’ve never met him before

37
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:48,970
so why does he feel somewhat familiar ?

38
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,170
No answer ?

39
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,650
You can die then.

40
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,850
Senior,

41
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:55,810
among the other 5, there must be someone you know.

42
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:58,050
Junior admits her mistake.

43
00:02:58,320 --> 00:03:01,210
After my father disappeared in the Immortal Graveyard

44
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,330
I was sold to the country of Suzaku.

45
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:05,440
I became a cultivation furnace,

46
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,170
living a life worse than death.

47
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:09,140
I refused to accept it

48
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,450
and luckily managed to escape.

49
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:12,530
That's when I met Elder Gongsun.

50
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,760
He didn’t abandon me

51
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,400
and has protected me ever since.

52
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,450
He was even willing to accompany me to the Immortal Graveyard

53
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:20,210
to search for traces of my father.

54
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:23,190
To divert the attention of the Forsaken Immortal Clan,

55
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,850
I used the Reincarnation Fruits as bait.

56
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:26,450
and invited 5 others to join me.

57
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,650
But I failed to find my father

58
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,850
so I had no choice but to leave.

59
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,570
Senior,

60
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,490
I was the one who hid the truth.

61
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,250
If Senior wants to kill someone,

62
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:57,170
then kill this Junior.

63
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,050
Don’t hurt Elder Gongsun.

64
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:00,770
Miss,

65
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,330
let him kill me.

66
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,930
I would rather die now

67
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,490
than live as someone's tattoo puppet.

68
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,130
Find Wang Lin

69
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:21,570
and I'll let you two live.

70
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:30,890
Impossible,

71
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:33,370
how could a furnace chosen by Suzaku

72
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:35,050
have escaped so easily ?

73
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:38,510
Gongsun Fan was clearly marked by a tattoo seed

74
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,010
yet he’s different from the others,

75
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,690
and they managed to escape unscathed.

76
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,170
There must be

77
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,650
someone else backing them.

78
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,650
I left drops of blood within their bodies

79
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:55,050
so that I can find my way.

80
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:58,170
A few days later

81
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,650
Senior...

82
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,090
I...

83
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,570
Senior...

84
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,930
The thing is,

85
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,490
this was all your fault.

86
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,410
Wait !

87
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:32,470
This trip to the Immortal Graveyard was truly perilous.

88
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,570
Fortunately,

89
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:36,770
I obtained a Reincarnation Fruit needed for my body cleansing.

90
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:53,170
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

91
00:05:53,080 --> 00:06:00,910
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,
like the descent of a god.

92
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,610
I have finally become

93
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,770
a true Ancient God.

94
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,890
3 years later

95
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,570
Our Apricot Village

96
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:22,690
is undergoing the Heaven's Path Sect's recruitment.

97
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:25,530
Son, listen carefully to what they say.

98
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:27,170
If any child is chosen

99
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:29,290
it will be a great honor for its family.

100
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,290
Yes !

101
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,770
Zhou Ru
5 years old

102
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,850
Next

103
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,690
None of them have Spirit Roots...

104
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,890
This kid,

105
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:52,250
I’ll take her.

106
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,330
Immortal,

107
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:57,530
this child is born mute.

108
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,250
No problem.

109
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:03,370
Thank you, Immortal

110
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,330
Ru’er,

111
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:06,130
bow to your master.

112
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,130
Hurry...

113
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:08,410
This child is so fortunate !

114
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,410
Innate spiritual energy,

115
00:07:20,200 --> 00:07:22,290
all her meridians are opened,

116
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,850
and a purple aura.

117
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,410
Move faster, damn it !

118
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,610
If I miss the spirit stone exchange,

119
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:40,970
you’ll regret it !

120
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:46,850
Stupid girl !

121
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,770
I’ll beat you to death.

122
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,330
Do you dare ?

123
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:00,130
Senior...

124
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:00,850
I...

125
00:08:25,600 --> 00:08:26,890
Wan’er...

126
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:32,690
Uncle

127
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,650
Can you speak ?

128
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:47,010
Would you like to cultivate with me ?

129
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:58,610
She will eventually step into cultivation world.

130
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,850
Since her parents can’t protect her,

131
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:04,110
I might as well take her with me

132
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,690
to ensure her safety.

133
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,290
Ceng Niu,

134
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,290
come out and fight me !

135
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,010
Ceng Niu,

136
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:14,210
you have such a reputation

137
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,850
yet you hide in the valley, afraid to fight ?

138
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,690
Are you afraid of losing ?

139
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,450
We’re home.

140
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:32,490
Hungry ?

141
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:12,170
The chopsticks are flying !

142
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:14,930
Go ahead.

143
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,730
Why don't you eat ?

144
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:24,070
Once you reach a certain level of cultivation

145
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,810
you no longer need to eat.

146
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:36,930
I dreamed that my parents were gone.

147
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:40,050
Everything around me was pitch black.

148
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:40,970
Only...

149
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:44,050
Only I was left.

150
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,290
I’m here,

151
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,330
don’t be afraid.

152
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:51,410
What if you’re not here in the future ?

153
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,130
So shiny...

154
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,250
This is for you.

155
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,930
If you ever need me,

156
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,290
just shake it

157
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,010
and I’ll appear.

158
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,090
Wan’er...

159
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:18,090
Ceng Niu,

160
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,370
you coward !

161
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,610
Do you dare to come out and fight ?

162
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,290
Ceng Niu,

163
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,010
come out and fight me !

164
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,810
I’ll let you take one of my arms.

165
00:11:24,340 --> 00:11:25,810
I’ll let you take both of my arms !

166
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,090
Attack !

167
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,330
You're noisy.

168
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:10,410
10-ingredients tonic soup

169
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,850
Come and take a look !

170
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,810
Do you like it ?

171
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:21,210
Dad, I want this !

172
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:21,890
Alright

173
00:12:26,710 --> 00:12:27,690
It's delicious !

174
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,090
Slow down !

175
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:11,770
Uncle,

176
00:13:11,540 --> 00:13:14,070
help me to capture this little pet.

177
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:28,960
If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes,

178
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:31,810
I wouldn’t have believed Wan’er was like this.

179
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:41,610
5 years later

180
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,370
Uncle !

181
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,130
What's the matter ?

182
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:42,610
Wang Lin's avatar
Middle stage Soul Formation

183
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:46,210
Zhou Ru
10 years old

184
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,530
Nothing.

185
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:50,810
Little Ru'er,

186
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:51,890
hide in the pagoda.

187
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:55,890
Ceng Niu, come out !

188
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,700
Xue Ye’s Liao Fen is here

189
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,530
to ask for the feather fan back.

190
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,250
Liao Fan
Country of Xue Yue
Late stage Soul Formation

191
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,410
Ceng Niu,

192
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,370
I am here to settle the grudge

193
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:05,290
between you

194
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,690
and Xue Yue !

195
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,290
Kill !

196
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:19,130
If you are only this strong,

197
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,460
then you will

198
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,610
meet your end.

199
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:26,610
Today is the 17th of March.

200
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:27,770
Ceng Niu,

201
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,770
this is the day you die !

202
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,970
Sonic Wave Spirit Armor !

203
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:05,330
Which one of you bastards dared to hurt me ?

204
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,450
This voice...

205
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:08,690
Is this...

206
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:12,050
the chilling aura of the Underworld Ascension Method ?

207
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:16,820
Quickly find a Yin energy gathering location

208
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:19,530
to cultivate the Underworld Ascension Method.

209
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,690
Underworld Ice Flame ?

210
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,770
How do you know this technique ?

211
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,770
Who the hell are you ?

212
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:40,980
It wouldn't hurt to tell you,

213
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:41,970
my name is

214
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,370
Situ Nan !

215
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:02,970
Go away !

216
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,290
Situ Nan...

217
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,610
How could this be ?

218
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,010
Impossible...

219
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:32,970
Impossible !

220
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,810
Senior Situ,

221
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:42,250
if that really was your severed arm,

222
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,850
then I kind of believe what you said back then.

223
00:16:50,040 --> 00:17:02,920
Note: "Suzaku" is the name of the country and planet
"the Suzaku" is the title of strongest individual on planet Suzaku

224
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:52,410
But the title of Suzaku's strongest person

225
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:55,370
is held by the one and only Suzaku.

226
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:58,010
Were you

227
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:00,130
really the Suzaku ?

228
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:03,810
Senior Situ,

229
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,290
the 10-year agreement is near.

230
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,090
My chances of winning this battle are slim

231
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,690
but there’s no avoiding it.

232
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,890
Little White,

233
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:15,610
look up !

234
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:17,730
Look down !

235
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:22,130
Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,

236
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,010
The 10-year agreement is up.

237
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:27,730
Mount Suzaku ordered me

238
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:29,890
to escort you.

239
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:36,610
Tie Yan,

240
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,410
Yes ?

241
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:39,050
The Thunder Frog and the pagoda

242
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,050
will stay here.

243
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,690
No one can enter within a 100 li radius.

244
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,010
While I’m gone,

245
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:46,170
take good care of Little Ru’er for me.

246
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:47,570
Benefactor, don’t worry.

247
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:49,770
This old man will ensure the safety

248
00:17:50,080 --> 00:17:51,610
of lady Ru’er.

249
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,410
Little Ru’er,

250
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:55,930
come here.

251
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:57,570
Bad Uncle !

252
00:17:57,560 --> 00:18:00,330
You go out to play by yourself without taking Little Ru'er.

253
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,530
While I’m away,

254
00:18:08,560 --> 00:18:10,370
listen to Uncle Tie Yan.

255
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,760
When I come back,

256
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:13,410
I’ll catch an even bigger tiger for you.

257
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:15,970
Really ?

258
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,530
Even bigger than Little White ?

259
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:20,170
Even bigger than Little White.

260
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,890
Okay,

261
00:18:23,240 --> 00:18:25,410
but you have to come back quickly.

262
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:41,250
Uncle !

263
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:46,090
Uncle...

264
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,610
You must return safely...

265
00:18:51,560 --> 00:18:52,450
Alright,

266
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,730
you also take care of yourself.

267
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:22,490
Master !

268
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,650
I’ve thoroughly investigated Ceng Niu’s strength

269
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,290
Tell me.

270
00:19:27,770 --> 00:19:28,850
This Ceng Niu

271
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:30,930
is now at Middle stage Soul Formation.

272
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,070
His domain

273
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:34,780
seems to be the Life and Death reincarnation cycle.

274
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:36,800
He has a flying sword that can chop anything

275
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:34,090
Li Yuanfeng
Xue Yue's Suzerain
Early stage Soul Transformation

276
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:38,130
and a mysterious pagoda.

277
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,810
Not only that

278
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:42,490
but I used the treasure you gave me to test him

279
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:43,410
and he...

280
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:46,570
also masters the Underworld Ascension Method.

281
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,770
In the past,

282
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:49,730
he severed Red Butterfly’s arm.

283
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,290
And now,

284
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:53,370
he caught the attention of the Suzaku.

285
00:19:53,680 --> 00:19:56,290
How could he be an ordinary person ?

286
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:58,250
So what you told me before,

287
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,840
do we forget about it ?

288
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,170
It’s not the right time yet,

289
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:05,690
I’ve already set up the trap.

290
00:20:06,160 --> 00:20:08,290
After he fights Red Butterfly,

291
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:10,410
I’ll make my move.

292
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,730
Regardless of the outcome,

293
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:18,370
Ceng Niu

294
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:20,730
will die for sure.

295
00:20:57,430 --> 00:21:00,980
To let go of the consequences of my actions

296
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:02,700
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

297
00:21:02,490 --> 00:21:04,640
like scattered ink.

298
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:12,120
As destiny falls

299
00:21:08,110 --> 00:21:12,120
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

300
00:21:11,870 --> 00:21:19,720
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

301
00:21:15,110 --> 00:21:19,720
wither and melt into rivers.

302
00:21:19,910 --> 00:21:27,280
Who can deceive

303
00:21:22,670 --> 00:21:27,280
the law of the heavens ?

304
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:30,600
Countless generations

305
00:21:28,630 --> 00:21:30,600
have tried before me.

306
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:34,320
But how could I not catch my dreams

307
00:21:32,470 --> 00:21:34,320
within my warm fingers ?

308
00:21:34,630 --> 00:21:38,400
You're at my side when I'm alone

309
00:21:38,150 --> 00:21:41,720
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

310
00:21:42,230 --> 00:21:45,680
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

311
00:21:45,790 --> 00:21:49,880
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

312
00:21:47,630 --> 00:21:49,880
in the streets.

313
00:21:49,790 --> 00:21:54,840
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

314
00:21:51,350 --> 00:21:54,840
Can I break the rules ?

315
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:57,560
To run towards you !

316
00:21:57,350 --> 00:22:00,880
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

317
00:22:00,630 --> 00:22:05,520
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

318
00:22:05,270 --> 00:22:08,920
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

319
00:22:08,710 --> 00:22:13,600
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

320
00:22:13,800 --> 00:22:19,280
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

321
00:22:19,150 --> 00:22:23,200
If your soul is willing to wander,

322
00:22:22,950 --> 00:22:27,840
can I still take your hands

323
00:22:24,630 --> 00:22:27,840
and hold them tight ?

324
00:22:27,750 --> 00:22:30,920
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

325
00:22:30,670 --> 00:22:35,800
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

326
00:22:35,560 --> 00:22:39,080
I dream of destroying

327
00:22:38,990 --> 00:22:43,800
the shackles of our fate.

328
00:22:43,550 --> 00:22:47,760
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

329
00:22:47,510 --> 00:22:50,560
You're the hardest to let go of.

330
00:22:50,390 --> 00:22:54,440
I want to be with you again

331
00:22:54,270 --> 00:22:57,800
so I can look in your eyes.

332
00:22:57,830 --> 00:23:03,040
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
